      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Authors, following 100 dysmenorrheal women (14-45 aged) examination and following symptoms collection, tested 40 patients by the acupuncture and auricular therapy. Before a short introduction on the dysmenorrhea etiology, the Authors explain the acupuncture therapy applied on 20 patients before treated with other therapies without success and cases 20 untreated patients describing the clinical cases and the different results."},
